# Captain's log, stardate 41153.7

Our destination is planet Deneb IV, beyond which lies the great unexplored mass of the galaxy. **Commander Riker** will join us at [Farpoint Station](https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/Farpoint_Station).

